      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2022-june/q2",
      "question": "<p>(a) Express the complex number <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w = 4\\sqrt{3} - 4i\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r(\\cos \\theta + i \\sin \\theta)\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r &gt; 0\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-\\pi &lt; \\theta \\leq \\pi\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p><p>(b) Show, on a single Argand diagram,</p><p>(i) the point representing <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w\"></span></p><p>(ii) the locus of points defined by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arg(z + 10i) = \\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>(c) Hence determine the minimum distance of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w\"></span> from the locus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arg(z + 10i) = \\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
