    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2022-june/q3",
      "question": "<p>With respect to the right-hand rule, a rotation through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta^\\circ\"></span> anticlockwise about the y-axis is represented by the matrix</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix} \\cos \\theta &amp; 0 &amp; \\sin \\theta \\\\ 0 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ -\\sin \\theta &amp; 0 &amp; \\cos \\theta \\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>The point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> has coordinates (8, 3, 2)</p><p>The point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span> is the image of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> under the transformation reflection in the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y = 0\"></span></p><p>(a) Write down the coordinates of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></p><p>The point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span> is the image of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> under the transformation rotation through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"120^\\circ\"></span> anticlockwise about the y-axis, with respect to the right-hand rule.</p><p>(b) Determine the exact coordinates of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>(c) Hence find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\overrightarrow{PR}|\"></span> giving your answer as a simplified surd.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>(d) Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{PR}\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{PQ}\"></span> are perpendicular.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></p><p>(e) Hence determine the exact area of triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"PQR\"></span>, giving your answer as a surd in simplest form.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
      "steps": [
