    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2022-june/q4",
      "question": "<p>The roots of the quartic equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3x^4 + 5x^3 - 7x + 6 = 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\delta\"></span></p><p>Making your method clear and without solving the equation, determine the exact value of</p><p>(i) <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2 + \\gamma^2 + \\delta^2\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>(ii) <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{2}{\\alpha} + \\frac{2}{\\beta} + \\frac{2}{\\gamma} + \\frac{2}{\\delta}\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>(iii) <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3 - \\alpha)(3 - \\beta)(3 - \\gamma)(3 - \\delta)\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
