      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2022-june/q7",
      "question": "<p>Prove by mathematical induction that, for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\"></span></p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix} -5 &amp; 9 \\\\ -4 &amp; 7 \\end{pmatrix}^n = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 - 6n &amp; 9n \\\\ -4n &amp; 1 + 6n \\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></p>",
